  m_text: "GAME DEVELOPMENT CREDITS:\n\nChristine Chapman \u2014 Gameplay & Scene
    Developer\nWorked on player movement, character code, level layout, and game
    screens.\n\nJD Singh \u2014 Game Developer\nWorked on AI systems and A* pathfinding.\n\nDara
    Alegre \u2014 Artist\nCreated the ghosts, houses, tiles, and other visual assets.\n\nSOUND
    EFFECTS:\n\nReceived Mail Sound \u2014 Freesound_Community (Pixabay)\n\nDelivering
    Mail Sound \u2014 Freesound_Community (Pixabay)\n\nMUSIC:\n\nThe Ghost of You
    (Orchestral) \u2014 SLrathna (Pixabay)\n\n\n\n\n\nThank You For Playing!\nGhost
    Postmaster - Team"
